# Unit Testing Model Rule

## Critical Rules

### Related Rules
This rule must be used in conjunction with:
- [Testing General Principles](.cursor/rules/manual/testing-general-principles.mdc) - For fundamental testing principles and practices
- [Unit Testing Best Practices](.cursor/rules/manual/unit-testing-best-practices.mdc) - For general unit testing best practices

### Models

#### Model Interface and Type Testing
- Test if model implements required interfaces (e.g., `Entity`)
- Test entity type and table name
- Test fillable fields and appends
```php
public function testImplementsInterfaces(): void
{
    $this->assertInstanceOf(Entity::class, $this->model);
}

public function testEntityType(): void
{
    $this->assertEquals('storage_disks', $this->model->entityType());
}

public function testTableName(): void
{
    $this->assertEquals('storage_disks', $this->model->getTable());
}
```

#### Relation Testing
- Test relations by calling the relation method (e.g., `file()`)
- Assert the relation type (e.g., `BelongsTo`, `HasMany`)
- Don't test resolved models directly
```php
public function testFileRelation(): void
{
    $relation = $this->model->file();
    $this->assertInstanceOf(BelongsTo::class, $relation);
}
```

#### Model Event Testing
- Test model events using `invokePrivateMethod`
- Use `#[DoesNotPerformAssertions]` for tests that don't assert
```php
#[DoesNotPerformAssertions]
public function testModelDeletedEvent(): void
{
    $settings = Settings::partialMock();
    $settings->shouldReceive('destroy')
        ->with('storage', ['storage.disks.test_disk'])
        ->once();
    $this->invokePrivateMethod([$model, 'fireModelEvent'], 'deleted');
}
```

#### Model Attribute Testing
- Test computed attributes (getters)
- Test attribute casting
- Test attribute appends
```php
public function testGetUrlAttribute(): void
{
    $storage = $this->partialMock('MetaFox\Storage\Storage');
    $storage->shouldReceive('getUrl')
        ->with(1)
        ->andReturn('http://example.com/test.jpg');
    $this->app->instance('storage', $storage);
    $this->model->file_id = 1;
    $this->assertEquals('http://example.com/test.jpg', $this->model->url);
}
```

#### Model Method Testing
- Test public methods
- Use `invokePrivateMethod` for protected/private methods
- Test method return values and side effects
```php
public function testIsModified(): void
{
    $this->model->file_id = null;
    $this->model->local_path = MetaFoxConstant::EMPTY_STRING;
    $this->assertFalse($this->model->isModified());
}
```
